(   - Result: High Extraneous Cognitive Load. The audience expends all their mental energy) Tj
T*
(   deciphering chart mechanics rather than understanding the technical insight.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Knaflic's Data Storytelling Principles:) Tj
T*
(   - Principle 1: Eliminate Chartjunk & Maximize Data-Ink: Erase non-essential background borders,) Tj
T*
(   dark gridlines, 3D shadows, and redundant axis tick marks. Let the data breathe.) Tj
T*
(   - Principle 2: Use Color Strategically as an Attentional Beacon:) Tj
T*
(   * Render 90% of the chart elements \(baseline bars, historical timelines\) in muted, neutral gray) Tj
T*
(   tones \(`#CCCCCC`\).) Tj
T*
(   * Apply a single, high-contrast, bold primary color \(e.g., Deep Cobalt Blue or Vibrant Red\)) Tj
T*
(   EXCLUSIVELY to the single data series, bar, or anomaly that carries the core insight.) Tj
T*
(   - Principle 3: Direct Visual Labeling: Eliminate separate color legends that force the eye to) Tj
T*
(   bounce back and forth across the screen. Place textual labels directly beside the data lines.) Tj
T*
(   - Principle 4: Action Titles over Descriptive Headers: Replace generic titles \('Figure 4:) Tj
T*
(   Latency Benchmarks'\) with declarative insight titles: 'Our Redesigned In-Memory Cache Slashes) Tj
T*
(   99th-Percentile API Latency by 74%'.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Narrative Integration:) Tj
T*
(   - Data is not presented as an isolated mathematical fact; it is presented as the climax of an) Tj
T*
(   engineering struggle, proving that technical choices conquered user pain.) Tj
T*
() Tj
