(   - Historically, product organizations operated in linear handoffs: Product Managers wrote) Tj
T*
(   50-page PRD specification documents; UX Designers drew static mockups; Software Developers sat) Tj
T*
(   in isolation writing code to match specs without ever speaking to a customer.) Tj
