(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the 'Cognitive Walkthrough of a Product Pitch'. How does an entrepreneur simulate the mental model, biases, and emotional triggers of an angel investor before stepping into the room?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Purpose of Cognitive Pitch Auditing:) Tj
T*
(   - Just as engineers conduct a cognitive walkthrough of user interfaces, an entrepreneur must) Tj
T*
(   walk through their pitch deck from the cynical, distracted, and risk-averse mental model of an) Tj
T*
(   investor.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Four Psychological Questions of Investor Pitch Walkthrough:) Tj
T*
(   - Question 1: In the first 30 seconds, will the investor understand what we do, or will they be) Tj
T*
(   trapped in cognitive confusion?) Tj
T*
(   * Audit: Strip away buzzwords. If the title slide reads 'Decentralized AI Web3 Synergies', the) Tj
T*
(   investor is confused. Change to: 'We automate customer support for e-commerce stores using AI.') Tj
T*
(   - Question 2: When the problem is articulated, will the investor feel this is a) Tj
T*
(   multi-billion-dollar burning pain, or a trivial vitamin?) Tj
T*
(   * Audit: Anchor problem in quantifiable market metrics: dollars lost, hours wasted, or) Tj
T*
(   regulatory fines incurred.) Tj
T*
(   - Question 3: When the technology is shown, will the investor believe this team has an unfair,) Tj
T*
(   defensible advantage, or is it easily cloned by incumbents?) Tj
T*
(   * Audit: Highlight proprietary algorithms, exclusive data access, patents, or founder domain) Tj
T*
(   pedigrees.) Tj
T*
(   - Question 4: When the traction is revealed, does the data prove customer pull, or does it look) Tj
T*
(   like manufactured marketing hype?) Tj
T*
(   * Audit: Present clean, cohorted retention graphs that flatten, proving real product) Tj
T*
(   stickiness.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
