T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Multi-Audience Translation Challenge:) Tj
T*
(   - An engineering redesign impacts diverse stakeholders with fundamentally different incentives,) Tj
T*
(   mental models, and success metrics. A one-size-fits-all presentation alienates all groups.) Tj
T*
() Tj
