T*
(   \(p99\), and refactoring pull request breakdowns.) Tj
T*
(   - Audience 2: Product Managers & Scrum Masters:) Tj
T*
(   * Focus: Sprint velocity, release milestones, dependency decoupling, and user story acceptance) Tj
T*
(   criteria.) Tj
T*
(   * Artifacts: Burn-down projections, feature dependency trees, and risk mitigation schedules.) Tj
T*
(   - Audience 3: C-Suite Executives & Board Members:) Tj
T*
(   * Focus: Strategic business impact, Total Cost of Ownership \(TCO\), revenue acceleration, and) Tj
T*
(   competitive differentiation.) Tj
T*
(   * Artifacts: 1-page executive summaries, ROI models, Customer Lifetime Value \(LTV\) projections,) Tj
T*
(   and customer retention metrics.) Tj
T*
(   - Audience 4: End Users & Customer Support:) Tj
T*
(   * Focus: Day-to-day workflow disruption, learning curve, ergonomic efficiency, and peace of) Tj
T*
(   mind.) Tj
T*
(   * Artifacts: Visual side-by-side video walkthroughs, interactive sandboxes, and empathetic) Tj
T*
(   transition guides.) Tj
T*
