(   [Problem Statement]: Construct a comprehensive, end-to-end Case Study retrospective for the redesign of an enterprise Critical Care Patient Telemetry Platform.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context & Human Stakes:) Tj
T*
(   - An intensive care hospital telemetry system monitored 60 cardiac patients simultaneously.) Tj
T*
(   Nurses reported severe sensory fatigue from constant blaring false alarms. Over 18 months, 3) Tj
T*
(   clinical incidents occurred where genuine ventricular fibrillation alarms were missed amid a) Tj
T*
(   sea of trivial artifact chimes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. User Research & Empathy Discovery \(Unit 2\):) Tj
T*
(   - Shadowing nurses on 12-hour night shifts revealed that 88% of all auditory alarms were) Tj
T*
(   clinically irrelevant \(e.g., patient shifting in bed, loosening an electrode lead\). Nurses had) Tj
T*
(   become conditioned to reflexively hit 'Mute' within 2 seconds without looking at the) Tj
T*
(   electrocardiogram trace \(Severe Alarm Fatigue\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Divergent Ideation & Prototyping \(Units 3 & 4\):) Tj
T*
(   - Ideation \(SCAMPER & Six Thinking Hats\): The team applied 'E - Eliminate' and 'A - Adapt' from) Tj
T*
(   aviation dark-cockpit ergonomics.) Tj
T*
(   - Prototyping: Built low-fidelity paper overlays and simulated dynamic tablet wireframes,) Tj
T*
(   testing alarm categorization algorithms with clinical ICU specialists.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. The Strategic Redesign Architecture \(Units 5 & 6\):) Tj
T*
(   - Tiered Multimodal Alerting: Replaced 20 chaotic chimes with a 3-tier deterministic) Tj
T*
(   visual/acoustic hierarchy \(Info, Warning, Crisis\).) Tj
T*
(   - Artifact Suppression Algorithm: Implemented real-time multi-lead signal quality) Tj
T*
(   cross-checking that suppressed false alarms from patient motion.) Tj
T*
(   - Secondary Wearable Haptics: Integrated silent tactile wristband vibrations for assigned) Tj
T*
(   nurses, ending ambient room noise pollution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Quantitative Clinical & Business Impact:) Tj
T*
(   - False positive acoustic alarms plummeted by 73%.) Tj
T*
(   - Mean Time to Clinical Intervention for true cardiac crises improved from 48 seconds to 11) Tj
T*
(   seconds.) Tj
T*
(   - System Usability Scale \(SUS\) score soared from 48.0 \(Failing\) to 86.5 \(Grade A+ Excellent\).) Tj
T*
(   - Hospital network expanded the deployment across 1,200 beds, securing a $14M multi-year) Tj
T*
(   enterprise contract.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

